Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Helios: record live-only patches from the local polish
 tree

These were live on MMO-R but uncommitted in _wt_helios_polish:
- Helios/Act scripts: full damage in FIGHT, invuln only intro/interlude/dying/cinematic
- Scheduler holds during an Opening; Opening text says bonus window, not exclusive
- Herald/Helios body collidable; BossCombatListener lets Helios hits through
  and applies the AetherionItems DAMAGE stat to melee
- No natural mob spawns in helios_requiem / World Eater site
- World Eater Unbroken crust: no hidden damage limit
- plugin.yml: AetherionItems is a hard depend

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
